wa9|n|A place or building where athletic exercises are performed; a school for gymnastics. ; A school for the higher branches of literature and science; a preparatory school for the university; -- used esp. of German schools of this kind.	v:26ev,25,3;26eh,23,3~26ev,25,3;26eh,23,3	n:1063,75,6~1063,75,6	N:ork,70,7~ork,70,7
